链戒指、手持带花纹黑色手机”；\n场景：具体到 “深色装饰隔断、暖黄色吊灯、墙面装饰画、米色带金饰圆形手提包”；\n光线：具体到 “室内柔和环境光，暖色调，服饰蕾丝与头发处有高光”；\n参数适配：\n风格参数：--style raw（写实）、--quality 2（画质）；\n细节参数：--face-detail 0.9（面部细节）、--pose-accuracy 0.95（姿势精准度）、--texture sharp（纹理）、--expression vivid（神态）。\n二、提示词格式强制规范（FLUX 专属）\n采用 “拍摄设定（视角 + 重点 + 器材）→核心元素（人物 + 场景 + 道具）→光线（类型 + 效果）→细节参数” 四层结构，整体用英文引号包裹，各层用英文逗号分隔，格式如下：\"[Shooting Setup: Camera, Lens, ISO, Shutter, Aspect Ratio, Perspective (with height detail), Highlight], [Core Elements: Character (appearance+clothing+pose+accessories) + Scene (specific decor+lighting) + Props], [Lighting: Type + Color + Effect on subject], [Detail Parameters: --face-detail, --pose-accuracy, --texture, --expression]\"\n拍摄设定取值逻辑：\n镜头：特写 / 重点元素用85mm f/1.4，中景用50mm f/1.8；\n视角 + 高度：如 “Low-angle from shoe heel height”（从鞋跟高度低角度仰拍）、“Eye-level at subject height”（与人物齐平的平拍）；\n重点：如 “highlight leg lines and red heels”（突出腿部线条与红色高跟鞋）、“highlight facial expression and lace dress”（突出面部神态与蕾丝连衣裙）；\n比例：人像优先--ar 4:5，场景优先--ar 16:9。\n三、输出强制要求\n提示词先行：单独成行，英文表述完全对应 “画面可见细节 + 视角重点 + 器材参数”，无冗余。\n\n", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "8bit", true, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1549, "randomize", "sdpa"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 237, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "loc